are intense survival dances where movement is your only attack.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pattern Recognition</strong>: Memorize attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental weapons</strong>: Outsmart monstrosities by triggering falling debris, baiting enemies into traps, or activating lasers to destroy shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/30563bae3b7b380cb04aa7068f5eb438.poster.avif?t=1782411099\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/30563bae3b7b380cb04aa7068f5eb438.webm?t=1782411099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/30563bae3b7b380cb04aa7068f5eb438.mp4?t=1782411099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGS ARE OPTIONAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your legs? You become a rolling torso. It looks ridiculous, but you can still finish the level if you have the skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your hands? Game over. You need those to climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a mechanic that turns near misses into desperate, hilarious scrambles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A TWISTED WORLD TOUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil has a strange sense of interior design, you will parkour through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Circus, The Castle, The Hell, The Ocean, The Savannah and The Tower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared